PTX mixed-size+bar.sync
"A full-word store and a half-word load separated by a CTA barrier in every execution: no race; the load reads the stored half. Expected: forbidden."
{
x[0]=0;
x[1]=0;
P1:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0   | P1@cta 0,gpu 0       ;
 st.weak.b32 x, 1 | bar.sync 0           ;
 bar.sync 0       | ld.weak.b16 r0, x[1] ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 0)
